| Bread, toast, lasagne, pasta | @triticum-aestivum or @triticum-turgidum-durum; egg, milk, oil, and fillings vary. |
| Popcorn with soybean oil | @zea-mays and `@glycine-max`. |
| Gnocchi | @solanum-tuberosum; flour and egg content vary. |
| Mixed canned or cooked vegetables | Identify each ingredient; the dish name does not list them. |
| Acarajé | @vigna-unguiculata and @elaeis-guineensis are common bases; fillings vary. |
| Arroz carreteiro, baião de dois | @oryza-sativa; identify beef, cowpea, and other ingredients from the actual dish. |
| Barreado, dobradinha | @bos-taurus as a common base; cuts and other ingredients vary. |
